\"need to be improved\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 9px;\n    font-family: \"Comic Sans MS\", \"Segoe Print\", cursive;\n    font-size: 8px;\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    color: #6f5643;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    transform: rotate(-3deg);\n    opacity: .8;\n  }\n\n  .chart {\n    width: 478px;\n    height: 79px;\n    margin-top: 8px;\n    margin-left: -39px;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    table-layout: fixed;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 10.5px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .chart col:nth-child(1) { width: 31%; }\n  .chart col:nth-child(2) { width: 19%; }\n  .chart col:nth-child(3) { width: 31%; }\n  .chart col:nth-child(4) { width: 19%; }\n  .chart th {\n    height: 18px;\n    padding: 1px 2px;\n    color: #082d52;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    border-right: 1px solid #596875;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #7a858b;\n    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #e6faf9 0%, #efffff 50%, #d8f2f3 100%);\n  }\n  .chart td {\n    height: 60px;\n    border-right: 1px solid #777;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #888;\n  }\n  .chart th:last-child, .chart td:last-child { border-right: none; }\n  .chart tbody tr td:first-child { border-left: none; }\n\n  .page-number {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 63px;\n    bottom: 8px;\n    width: 29px;\n    height: 18px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #a7cf22;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    line-height: 18px;\n    text-align: center;\n    transform: rotate(-4deg);\n    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px #84b410;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"page\">\n  <header class=\"running-head\">\n    <span class=\"chapter-name\">We’re trying to save the earth!</span>\n    <span class=\"unit\">UNIT 13</span>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"exercise ex2c\">\n    <div class=\"badge\">2c</div>\n    <p class=\"instruction\">Fill in the blanks with the correct forms of the phrases in the box.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"phrase-box\">\n      <div>put to good use</div>\n      <div>build ... out of</div>\n      <div>pull down</div>\n      <div>set up</div>\n      <div>known for</div>\n      <div>not only ... but also</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"answer-panel\">\n      <ol>\n        <li>Amy Hayes lives in the U.K. Many of the old buildings in her neighborhood<br>\n          were <span class=\"blank w76\"><span class=\"hand\">pulled down</span></span>.\n        </li>\n        <li>All the rubbish and old things in Amy’s neighborhood were then<br>\n          <span class=\"blank w84\"><span class=\"hand\">put to good use</span></span> when Amy built her house.\n        </li>\n        <li>Amy is very creative. She <span class=\"blank w55\"><span class=\"hand\">built</span></span> her front gate\n          <span class=\"blank w55\"><span class=\"hand\">out of</span></span><br>\n          rocks and old glass bottles. She put an old boat on top of her house.\n        </li>\n        <li>Jessica Wong sells her bags in a small shop, but she has\n          <span class=\"blank w70\"><span class=\"hand\">also set up</span></span><br>\n          an online business to sell them.\n        </li>\n        <li>Though Jessica’s bags are made from old clothes, her bags are<br>\n          <span class=\"blank w63\"><span class=\"hand\">known for</span></span> being cute and useful.\n        </li>\n        <li>Wang Tao <span class=\"blank w63\"><span class=\"hand\">not only</span></span> makes large pieces of metal art that look like<br>\n          animals or humans, <span class=\"blank w63\"><span class=\"hand\">but also</span></span> makes smaller pieces for the home.\n        </li>\n      </ol>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"exercise ex2d\">\n    <div class=\"badge\">2d</div>\n    <p class=\"instruction\"><span class=\"underline-title\">Underline the words</span> in the passage based on the words below. What are<br>the differences?</p>\n\n    <div class=\"word-cloud\">\n      <div class=\"word-grid\">\n        <div class=\"word-cell\"><span class=\"note-above\">rethink</span><span class=\"pencil-underline\">think</span></div>\n        <div class=\"word-cell\"><span class=\"note-above\">useful</span><span class=\"pencil-underline\">use</span></div>\n        <div class=\"word-cell\"><span class=\"note-above\">unusual</span><span class=\"pencil-underline\">usual</span></div>\n        <div class=\"word-cell\"><span class=\"note-above\">recycling</span><span class=\"pencil-underline\">recycle</span></div>\n        <div class=\"word-cell\"><span class=\"note-above\">building</span><span class=\"pencil-underline\">build</span></div>\n        <div class=\"word-cell\"><span class=\"note-above tiny-note\">creation/creativity</span><span class=\"pencil-underline\">create</span></div>\n\n        <div class=\"word-cell\"><span class=\"pencil-underline\">special</span><span class=\"note-below\">especially</span></div>\n        <div class=\"word-cell\"><span class=\"pencil-underline\">recent</span><span class=\"note-below\">recently</span></div>\n        <div class=\"word-cell\"><span class=\"pencil-underline\">environment</span><span class=\"note-below tiny-note\">environmental</span></div>\n        <div class=\"word-cell\"><span class=\"pencil-underline\">important</span><span class=\"note-below\">importance</span></div>\n        <div class=\"word-cell\"><span class=\"pencil-underline\">protect</span><span class=\"note-below\">protection</span></div>\n        <div class=\"word-cell\"><span class=\"pencil-underline\">inspire</span><span class=\"note-below\">inspiration</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"exercise ex2e\">\n    <div class=\"badge\">2e</div>\n    <p class=\"instruction\">Make a list of things that need to be done to save the environment.<br>\n      Which things can be done by common people every day? Which things<br>\n      have to be done by governments and organizations? Discuss these with<br>\n      your group.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"grammar-notes\">\n      need to do sth. [illegible]\n      <span class=\"second\">need sth./v. need doing/to be done ([illegible]) [illegible]</span>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"exercise ex3a\">\n    <div class=\"badge\">3a</div>\n    <p class=\"instruction\">Think about the environment in your town/city and complete the chart<br>below.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"questions\">\n      Which parts of the town/city have a nice environment? Why are they nice?<br>\n      Which parts <span class=\"under-hand\">need to be improved</span>? Why?\n    </div>\n\n    <table class=\"chart\">\n      <colgroup>\n        <col><col><col><col>\n      </colgroup>\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th>Good environment</th>\n          <th>Why?</th>\n          <th>Bad environment</th>\n          <th>Why?</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr>\n          <td></td>\n          <td></td>\n          <td></td>\n          <td></td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"page-number\">103</div>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>"
